  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Africa&amp;#8211;Europe: Co-Driving the Green Global Economy</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;This 3-year Action aligns Africa and Europe&#xbf;s interests in green industrialisation, clean energy, and supply-chain resilience, supporting the EU&#xbf;s Global Gateway and AU&#xbf;s Agenda 2063.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;It aims to:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ql-ui&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;Promote green industrialisation within key stakeholder ecosystems.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ql-ui&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;Engage non-institutional partners.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ql-ui&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;Build ownership, improve understanding, and increase visibility.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Annual Focus Areas:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ql-ui&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2026:&lt;/strong&gt; Industrial energy &amp; power use&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ql-ui&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2027:&lt;/strong&gt; Agri-food processing &amp;amp; green fertilisers&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ql-ui&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2028:&lt;/strong&gt; Corridors, ports &amp;amp; logistics&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
